# What `VIAME_ENABLE_PYTORCH-SLEAP` adds.
#
# SLEAP-NN's training and inference runtime, from upstream f5caeae33.
# Notebook applications are not needed by the wrappers.
#
# Upstream's list carries `wandb<=0.25.0`, which is on this tree's exclusion
# list -- 86 MB of telemetry client that the trainers use only if configured
# -- so it is not here. Its list also says "OpenCV is supplied by fletch; do
# not install a competing wheel"; cv2 is `opencv-contrib-python-headless` in
# `base.in` since P1-T07, and there is no fletch.
#
# Compiled with the accelerator's lock as a constraint. Its own file rather
# than `base.in` because the option is off by default and this is thirty
# packages, `skia-python` and `textual` among them.

